{"c":[{"name":"20261003T051909Z-10a9c6959d310436","text":"The conversation cap can cause wrong fills, not just blanks: with calibration sources relabelled as Messages it cut the meeting block and Jev filled Meeting date with the order's Placed date (scripts/live-replay.ts, B11).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T051909Z-f82b591e5e9c3894","text":"Conversations (helper/src/conversation.ts: chat/mail bundle, composer under 3+ message lines, or stamped sender rows) give under half their text and at most 600 chars per Jev request, however short; the ledger also charges lines a taken text contains (B11).","type":"note"}]}
